  "identifier": "gow-ragnarok-hjalti-guide-2026",
  "headline": "Hjalti the Stolid guide (God of War Ragnarok): spacing vs shockwaves and daze pressure",
  "description": "Hjalti wins on tempo breaks. Keep spacing, avoid over-committing in close range, and punish only after slam/shockwave sequences.",
  "keywords": [
    "hjalti the stolid guide",
    "berserker",
    "shockwave",
    "daze",
    "strategy"
  ],
  "articleBody": "1) Failure mode\n- getting clipped by shockwaves into follow-up hits\n- losing healing windows to daze pressure\n\n2) Prep\n- mid-range plan, short runics, one reset relic\n\n3) Fixed plan\n1) do not stay in close range\n2) dodge slam into shockwave, then create space\n3) punish once at the end state, reset\n\n4) Three punish windows\n- post-slam recovery\n- post-shockwave recovery\n- end of heavy strings\n\nRelated: check the all-Berserkers index for gravestone routing.",
